SCOPE OF THE ABOVE

The MIT licence above covers only what this update added:

  - the conditional rewrite of the patch operation
  - the English and French documentation, and the packaging
  - About/Preview.png and About/ModIcon.png, which are new work

IT DOES NOT COVER THE ORIGINAL MOD. The idea, and the two numbers that are the
whole of it, are Buitrago's work, reused here:

  https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2625574564

Buitrago never declared a licence for them, so none is granted here and none can
be. They are redistributed under the usual practice for abandoned mods -
explicit credit, a link to the original, and removal on request.

If Buitrago asks for this to be taken down, it comes down. Immediately, and
without discussion.

ATTRIBUTION.md records what was taken and what was changed.
